(property "Description" "Functional RF feed/return interface of the selected external A419 antenna assembly; named center/shield ports do not invent internal PCB pad numbers. | module | Exactly one profile antenna/feed drives this interface. For a discrete external LNA, it identifies the existing antenna-side input connector and its shield. For an integrated active patch, CENTER and SHIELD express its internal antenna feed and RF return; no accessible extra SMA is asserted.; The interface is assembly-owned and adds no separately purchased connector. J403 remains the handheld P3 connection on the receiver-facing side. Confirm the chosen profile assembly and its real connectors during its existing hardware acceptance." (at 0 0 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (hide yes)))
